WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.740
Alexandria, Egypt, around the year 318.

2
00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:06.620
A priest named Arius starts an argument.

3
00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:10.540
It spreads until it splits the
Church and reaches the emperor.

4
00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:16.330
In 325, the emperor Constantine calls
bishops together at Nicaea to settle it.

5
00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:20.950
Was Jesus fully God, or the first
and greatest thing God made?

6
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.080
And why did it matter so much?

7
00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:25.980
In this mission, you'll follow
both sides of the argument,

8
00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:28.120
and the creed the council wrote.

9
00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:31.640
Then you'll read what John's
Gospel says about the Word,

10
00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:34.350
in the beginning, before the world.

11
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:39.160
Your mission: find out what was at
stake in the argument over who Jesus is.
